{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31941","headline":"送南卓归京 · 贾岛","name":"送南卓归京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"残春别镜陂，罢郡未霜髭。\n行李逢炎暑，山泉满路岐。\n云藏巢鹤树，风触啭莺枝。\n三省同虚位，双旌带去思。\n入城宵梦後，待漏月沈时。\n长策幷忠告，从容写玉墀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31941.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31941","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}